/-!
# Genuine elliptic extension of global holomorphic-form coefficients

The native filled elliptic covers and their exact logarithmic gauges
extend the coefficients in Lemma 9.16(i) across both entire elliptic
orbits. The extensions are unique, retain their actual group covariance,
and satisfy the cusp-order estimates obtained from the filled cusp.

No form normal-form, elliptic extension, cusp factorization, or period-map
existence is assumed. The base one-form coefficient is extended after
vanishing of its vertical coefficient, as required by the gauge formula.
-/
